# Validation artifacts a run writes into the checkout it is validating. The
# runner refuses to execute from a checkout that carries anything the candidate
# counts as an input, so the plan it is handed, the applicability document
# beside it, and the receipts it produces are declared here as the operational
# files they are.
/plan.json
/plan.err
/applicability.json
/request.txt
/reuse.out
/receipts/
